        <mxCell id="A99nmO6RLz12Ya_JZG_t-103" parent="1" style="html=1;shadow=0;dashed=0;shape=mxgraph.bootstrap.rrect;rSize=5;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#6C767D;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=14;spacing=10;" value="All data storages are registered with the central management plane of `lib-data`, the data storage singleton (`DataStorage`). All `IStorage` implementations can be ordered and managed by the application. However, the databases and their content are automatically managed by the library.&lt;div&gt;Technically, caching storages should be placed first, so `lib-model` will first ask the caches.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
